olor:#18181b;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;margin:0 0 16px">You&#x27;ve been added to Platform</h1><p class="sb-text" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#18181b;margin:0 0 24px;margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:24px;margin-left:0">Grace Hopper added you to Platform on SurveyBeat. The team uses it for short, regular check-ins on how everyone is doing.</p><a class="sb-button" href="https://app.surveybeat.app/" style="line-height:100%;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;max-width:100%;mso-padding-alt:0px;background-color:#4338ca;border-radius:8px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 20px;padding-top:12px;padding-right:20px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-left:20px" target="_blank"><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%;mso-text-raise:18px" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;</i><![endif]--></span><span style="max-width:100%;display:inline-block;line-height:120%;mso-padding-alt:0px;mso-text-raise:9px">Open SurveyBeat</span><span><!--[if mso]><i style="mso-font-width:500%" hidden>&#8202;&#8202;&#8203;</i><![endif]--></span></a><p class="sb-muted" style="font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#52525b;margin:24px 0 0;margin-top:24px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">If the button does not work, open this link:<!-- --> <a class="sb-link" href="https://app.surveybeat.app/" style="color:#4338ca;text-decoration-line:none;word-break:break-all" target="_blank">https://app.surveybeat.app/</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table><hr class="sb-rule" style="width:100%;border:none;border-color:transparent;border-top:1px solid #e4e4e7;margin:24px 0 12px"/><p class="sb-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#52525b;margin:0;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0">You received this email because Grace Hopper added you to Platform.</p><p class="sb-muted" style="font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#52525b;margin:4px 0 0;margin-top:4px;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0">SurveyBeat helps teams check in o